      "message": "Put the record on a profile page, and make the Lens cobalt\n\nA person's or an agent's page now carries their record, the\nreputation the forge can actually compute: what landed and what was\nabandoned, the share of their re-run claims a runner reproduced, how\nmany claims carried a command, how many human looks passed and how\nmany blocked, and the gaps they declared, over the last ninety days\nand counted from the log with nothing declared. An organisation shows\nnone, since its people have theirs.\n\nThe agent mark is the plain Lens again: one eye on a flat cobalt\nhousing, looking where the id says, blinking at work. The iris print\nand the iron housing are gone; cobalt is the one colour the product\nmeans something by, and agents are the one thing drawn in it. The\ndrawing's generation moves to two, so cached marks are replaced.\n\nTask: t-13dzhyeq7gwfxh65vxt93297cz\nChange-Id: Irecord0133\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
